"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le08ob07re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le08ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le08ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey V! Are you doing that hypnosis stuff now? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I've started. I've gone to 2 sessions so far.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How are you finding it? Is hypnosis for you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure. I think I'm going to have to start looking at other options. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why do you say that?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't experienced much change in my sleeping patterns."}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn6le08ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa, you ought to give it some time. You should know these things don't work right away. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know. I've got to relax. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You have got to be less concerned with this. If it works, then that's great. If it doesn't, you can say you've tried it. Besides, there are many different remedies for you to try.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Like what? I've already tried a bunch."}, {"time": "50000", "image": "engenn6le08ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You'd better try some traditional Chinese medicine. I've learned so much about it from visiting China.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't considered that route. I need do some research. I'm going to have to give it some thought.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I could give you some ideas if you want.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey V! Are you doing that hypnosis stuff now? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I've started. I've gone to 2 sessions so far.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How are you finding it? Is hypnosis for you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure. I think I'm going to have to start looking at other options. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why do you say that?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't experienced much change in my sleeping patterns.<br><br>\n\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa, you ought to give it some time. You should know these things don't work right away. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know. I've got to relax. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You have got to be less concerned with this. If it works, then that's great. If it doesn't, you can say you've tried it. Besides, there are many different remedies for you to try.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Like what? I've already tried a bunch.<br><br>\n\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You'd better try some traditional Chinese medicine. I've learned so much about it from visiting China.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't considered that route. I need do some research. I'm going to have to give it some thought.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I could give you some ideas if you want.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure."}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Is Hypnosis for Me?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > The Inner Mind > A Piece of Advice"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le08ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "session"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of time used for a particular activity."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've gone to 2 sessions of hypnosis so far."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about sleeping issues. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alternative"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you can choose to do instead of something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are other alternatives you can try."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "concerned"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "worried about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You shouldn't be so concerned about this."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "traditional"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "following ideas and methods that have existed for a long time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can try some traditional Chinese remedies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Chinese medicine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a kind of medicine that uses herbs and acupuncture"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have got to try Chinese medicine."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "route"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way of achieving a specifIc result"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I haven't considered that route. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob07aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect vs. Past Simple "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way.  You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> tense to talk about a finished action or event not necessarily connected to the present."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've started the hypnosis. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I haven't seen much improvement in my sleeping patterns. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about experiences.<br/> When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now.</p> Look at the chart about how to form the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">have</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> <span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">not</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tried\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember you can use the contracted form when speaking:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I have/have not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" =\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I've/I haven't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She has/has not \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"=\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She's/She hasn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He has/has not \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"= \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's/He hasn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They have/have not \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"= \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They've/They haven't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You have/have not \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"= \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You've/You haven't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We have/have not \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"= \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We've/We haven't\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Necessity and Advisability"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about what is necessary, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>.</br> When you talk about what is advisable, you use <span class=\"italic\">need to, could, should, ought to,</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Necessary\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advisability\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You've got to relax.</p>  I'm going to have to give it some thought.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I could give some ideas if you want.</p> You ought to give it some time.</p> You'd better try some traditional medicine.</p> She should think about it.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go to the library or on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find examples of traditional Chinese medicine that could help with sleeping problems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find examples of other alternatives to traditional Chinese medicine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the different examples you found. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph (8-10 lines) about what you think is necessary to try for someone who is having sleeping problems. What would you advise?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your paragraph."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I offer advice about health."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what is necessary. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about solutions to sleeping problems."}]}]}